<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Evaluation of <span id="S5.T2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FlexOlmo</span> trained on <em id="S5.T2.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">eight</em> sets (public mix and seven simulated closed sets) on 31 tasks across 10 categories, tested with 1,000 samples per subtask.
“no RT” indicates no optional router training on proxy data (§<a href="#S3.SS3.SSS3" title="3.3.3 Optional Router Training on Proxy Data ‣ 3.3 Training Algorithm ‣ 3 FlexOlmo: LMs with Flexible Data Use ‣ FlexOlmo: Open Language Models for Flexible Data Use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3.3</span></a>).</span></figcaption>
